      "value": "I have noticed that sometimes it isn't having a unoptimized avatar that causes lag/jiggers but colliders messing up with other coliders making the calculations go haywire ( noticed this with a home world where a bottle with collider would lag me and the others just because someone with a collider in the hand picked it up",
